```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Learner as Learner
    participant UI as AiTutorTextChatScreen
    participant Repo as AiTutorRepository
    participant ContextSvc as LearnerContextService
    participant PromptBuilder as TutorSystemPromptBuilder
    participant CredStore as AiCredentialStorage
    participant RestProvider as GeminiRestAiProvider
    participant GeminiAPI as Google Gemini API Endpoint
    participant DB as SQLite (chat_messages & learner_evidence)

    Learner->>UI: Types question or practice dialogue
    UI->>Repo: sendMessage(sessionId, userMessage)
    Repo->>DB: Save user message in chat_messages
    
    %% Context Construction
    Repo->>ContextSvc: buildLearnerContext()
    ContextSvc->>DB: Fetch recent errors, mastery gaps & target HSK level
    ContextSvc-->>Repo: LearnerContext (weak items, vocabulary scope)
    
    Repo->>PromptBuilder: buildSystemPrompt(persona, scenario, learnerContext)
    PromptBuilder-->>Repo: Strict JSON System Instruction (Anti-Hallucination rules)

    %% Credential & Network
    Repo->>CredStore: getGeminiApiKey()
    CredStore-->>Repo: Decrypted API Key (from FlutterSecureStorage)
    
    Repo->>RestProvider: generateContent(messages, config, systemPrompt)
    RestProvider->>GeminiAPI: POST https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/...
    GeminiAPI-->>RestProvider: 200 OK (Candidates JSON)
    
    %% Response Validation & Parsing
    RestProvider-->>Repo: AiCompletionResponse
    Repo->>Repo: TutorResponseParser.parse(text)
    Note over Repo: Validates JSON format: reply_zh, pinyin, reply_vi, corrections, evidence_proposal
    
    Repo->>DB: Save tutor response in chat_messages
    alt Valid Evidence Proposal Returned
        Repo->>DB: Save approved evidence proposal to learner_evidence
    end

    Repo-->>UI: TutorResponse State Update
    UI-->>Learner: Display Tutor Message with Ruby Text & Correction Chips
```
